                            <h3>Core Analytics Skills</h3>
                            <p>Build a strong foundation in the tools used by modern data analysts. Learn Excel, SQL,
                                Power BI, Python and Statistics to collect, clean, analyse and interpret data
                                confidently.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="career-card">
                            <h3>Data Visualization</h3>
                            <p>Learn how to transform raw and complex data into meaningful insights. Build interactive
                                dashboards, clear visualizations and compelling reports that help businesses understand
                                what the data is saying.</p>
