                            <h3>Generative AI Foundations</h3>
                            <p>Understand how large language models work and where they fit into analytics workflows.
                                Work hands-on with ChatGPT, Gemini and open-source models to automate everyday analysis
                                tasks.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="career-card">
                            <h3>Prompt Engineering &amp; LLM Apps</h3>
                            <p>Write prompts that produce reliable, repeatable output. Build retrieval-augmented
                                assistants with LangChain and Hugging Face that answer questions over your own business
                                data.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

